  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Contains Hibernate-specific setup options as an alternative to JPA bootstrapping,\nprimarily for use with Hibernate's native <code>SessionFactory#getCurrentSession()</code>\nbut potentially also for JPA repositories or mixed use of native Hibernate and JPA.",
      "translation": "包含 Hibernate 特定的设置选项，可作为 JPA 引导的替代方案，主要用于配合 Hibernate 原生的 `<code>SessionFactory#getCurrentSession()</code>`，但也可能适用于 JPA 仓库或混合使用原生 Hibernate 和 JPA 的场景。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "As of Spring Framework 7.0, this package supersedes <code>orm.hibernate5</code> -\nnow for use with Hibernate ORM 7.1+, tightly integrated with JPA.",
      "translation": "自 Spring Framework 7.0 起，该包取代了 `<code>orm.hibernate5</code>`——现用于与 Hibernate ORM 7.1+ 配合使用，并与 JPA 紧密集成。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../../dao/support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.dao.support\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code></a> capable of translating <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/HibernateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>HibernateException</code></a>\nand standard JPA <code>PersistenceException</code> instances to Spring'\n<a href=\"../../../dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a> hierarchy.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../../dao/support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.dao.support\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code></a> 能够将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/HibernateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>HibernateException</code></a>和标准的 JPA <code>PersistenceException</code> 实例转换为 Spring 的<a href=\"../../../dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a> 层次结构。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A Spring-provided extension of the standard Hibernate <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/cfg/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate.cfg\"><code>Configuration</code></a> class,\nadding <a href=\"SpringSessionContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.orm.jpa.hibernate\"><code>SpringSessionContext</code></a> as a default and providing convenient ways\nto specify a JDBC <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> and an application class loader.",
      "translation": "Spring 提供的标准 Hibernate <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/cfg/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate.cfg\"><code>Configuration</code></a> 类的扩展，默认添加了 <a href=\"SpringSessionContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.orm.jpa.hibernate\"><code>SpringSessionContext</code></a>，并提供了方便的方式来指定 JDBC <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> 和应用类加载器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring's implementation of Hibernate's <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/resource/beans/container/spi/BeanContainer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate.resource.beans.container.spi\"><code>BeanContainer</code></a> SPI,\ndelegating to a Spring <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/config/ConfigurableListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>ConfigurableListableBeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "Spring 对 Hibernate 的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/resource/beans/container/spi/BeanContainer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate.resource.beans.container.spi\"><code>BeanContainer</code></a>` SPI 的实现，委托给 Spring `<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/config/ConfigurableListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>ConfigurableListableBeanFactory</code></a>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Delegate for creating shareable <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/Session.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>Session</code></a>/<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/StatelessSession.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>StatelessSession</code></a>\nreferences for a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/SessionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于为给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/SessionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>创建可共享的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/Session.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>Session</code></a>/<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/StatelessSession.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>StatelessSession</code></a>引用的委托。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../../transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a>\nimplementation for a single Hibernate <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/SessionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../../transaction/PlatformTransactionManager.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>PlatformTransactionManager</code></a> 实现，用于单个 Hibernate <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/SessionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a> that creates a Hibernate <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/SessionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a> 用于创建 Hibernate <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/SessionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resource holder wrapping a Hibernate <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/Session.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>Session</code></a> (plus an optional <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/Transaction.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>Transaction</code></a>).",
      "translation": "包装 Hibernate <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/Session.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.hibernate\"><code>Session</code></a> 的资源持有者（外加一个可选的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/Transaction.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.hibernate\"><code>Transaction</code></a>）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementation of Hibernate's <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/context/spi/CurrentSessionContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate.context.spi\"><code>CurrentSessionContext</code></a> interface\nthat provides a Spring-managed current <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/Session.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>Session</code></a>.",
      "translation": "实现 Hibernate 的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/context/spi/CurrentSessionContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate.context.spi\"><code>CurrentSessionContext</code></a>` 接口，该接口提供由 Spring 管理的当前 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/5.6/javadocs/org/hibernate/Session.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.hibernate\"><code>Session</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Classes supporting the <code>org.springframework.orm.jpa</code> package.",
      "translation": "支持<code>org.springframework.orm.jpa</code>包的类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Package providing integration of JPA (Java Persistence API) with Spring concepts.",
      "translation": "提供将 JPA（Java 持久化 API）与 Spring 概念集成的包。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Internal support for managing JPA persistence units.",
      "translation": "用于管理 JPA 持久化单元的内部支持。",
      "count": 1
